---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & conditions"
  description="General information about using the Hireorbits website and discussing a potential service engagement."
>
  <PageHeading
    eyebrow="WEBSITE INFORMATION"
    title="Terms & conditions"
    description="Please read these notes when using our website or exploring a potential engagement."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose legal-copy">
      <p class="muted-note">Last updated: 14 September 2026</p>
      <h2>About this website</h2>
      <p>
        This website provides a general overview of Hireorbits Solution Private Limited, its
        capabilities, and contact channels. Service descriptions are informational and do not
        constitute a project agreement, employment offer, or guarantee of an outcome.
      </p>
      <h2>Service engagements</h2>
      <p>
        Project scope, staffing requirements, availability, pricing, delivery terms, and any other
        commitments need to be discussed and agreed separately. An enquiry or consultation request
        does not by itself establish an engagement.
      </p>
      <h2>Careers</h2>
      <p>
        Sending a CV expresses interest in potential opportunities. It does not guarantee a vacancy,
        interview, placement, or employment. Published talent areas describe our focus and are not a
        list of confirmed open positions.
      </p>
      <h2>Website content and links</h2>
      <p>
        Capabilities and company information may be updated. Please confirm details with our team
        before relying on them for a business decision. External links lead to services operated by
        other organizations under their own terms.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For questions or corrections relating to this website, email{' '}
        <a href="mailto:info@hireorbits.com">info@hireorbits.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
